Third-party data
----------------
Files under output/05-rice-shed/data/raw/ were obtained from third parties and
remain under their original terms, which this notice does not change:

- geoBoundaries gbOpen KOR ADM2 (CC BY 3.0) and ADM1 (Public Domain);
  see the CITATION-AND-USE file inside each geoBoundaries zip.
- OpenStreetMap / Nominatim data for 영광군 (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
  ODbL 1.0. The derived boundary layer
  output/05-rice-shed/presentation/data/korea-adm2.geo.json contains this
  OSM-derived geometry and geoBoundaries geometry, and is made available under
  ODbL 1.0 and CC BY 3.0 respectively, not under the reservation above.
- KOSIS (Statistics Korea), data.go.kr (Ministry of the Interior and Safety;
  SGIS), and GIR tables: Korean public data, subject to the terms stated on
  each source page.
- Factor transcriptions from the IPCC 2006 Guidelines, GIR NID 2025, and
  FAO (2011) are cited to their sources; the source documents are not
  redistributed here.

